<https://w3id.org/airo/incident/evidence/3a65862779c0> a airo:Evidence ;
    airo:evidenceText "FIN7 (also known as Sangria Tempest) is a financially motivated threat group with links to Russia, that has been operating since at least 2013, and that was previously thought to have been eliminated by the DOJ." ;
    airo:sourceDocId "4142" .

